# The one password that opens the offer. Set it in Vercel under
# Settings -> Environment Variables, for Production and Preview both.
#
# Not NEXT_PUBLIC_: that prefix is what inlines a value into the browser bundle,
# which for this variable would mean publishing the key next to the lock.
#
# Leave it unset and the gate is off and the offer is public — which is the
# right default for `next dev`, and the thing to check before sending the link.
#
# Changing it invalidates every cookie already issued, so this is also how you
# revoke a link that has been forwarded further than intended.
OFFER_PASSWORD=
